{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一名內地男子於西貢行山時不適，清醒送院治理。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">該名18歲男子，由政府飛行服務隊送到東區醫院治理，需用氧氣罩協助呼吸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方早上近十時接獲一名女子報案，稱一行八人行山。但男事主於麥理浩徑第二段近西灣亭附近時突然暈倒不適，於是報警求助。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HIKING-1300.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026f1oFLCiT981790660058.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HIKING-1300.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T06:20:07.526509+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}